  37:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * the TCPWM being used must be passed first, followed by the index of 
  38:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * the counter you want to touch next. 
  39:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * For some functions, you can manage multiple counters simultaneously. You 
